**Loop iterations** | 20-30 | `n_max` rounds |\n| **Total D2H transfers in full proof** | **120-300** | Critical bottleneck |\n\n**Granularity:** Mostly **per-AIR or per-batch**, except for the batched logup/zerocheck functions which do internal batching with memory limits.\n\n---\n\n### 9. **Files and Line Numbers Reference**\n\n| File | Lines | Function | Sync Type |\n|------|-------|----------|-----------|\n| `mod.rs` | 347-364 | `prove_zerocheck_and_logup_gpu()` | Loop driver |\n| `mod.rs` | 1012-1330 | `sumcheck_polys_batch_eval()` | **4-6 to_host() per round** |\n| `mod.rs` | 1217 | LogupMonomialBatch eval | Per-AIR D2H |\n| `mod.rs` | 1236 | ZerocheckMonomialBatch eval | Per-AIR D2H |\n| `mod.rs` | 1306 | ZerocheckMonomialParYBatch eval | Per-AIR D2H |\n| `mod.rs` | 1323 | ZerocheckMonomialBatch eval | Per-AIR D2H |\n| `batch_mle.rs` | 505-626 | `evaluate_logup_batched()` | Multiple batches, 1-3 D2H |\n| `batch_mle.rs` | 414-501 | `evaluate_zerocheck_batched()` | Multiple batches, 1-2 D2H |\n| `batch_mle_monomial.rs` | 229-267 | `ZerocheckMonomialBatch::evaluate()` | Single kernel, single D2H |\n| `batch_mle_monomial.rs` | 753-792 | `LogupMonomialBatch::evaluate()` | Single kernel, single D2H |\n\nThe synchronization overhead is **quantifiably significant**: with a typical proof having 20-30 MLE rounds and 6-10 D2H operations per round, you're looking at **120-300 pipeline drains**, compared to the batch stacked reduction fix which eliminated one drain per window."}],"totalDurationMs":49351,"totalTokens":69851,"totalToolUseCount":14,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4540,"cache_read_input_tokens":61592,"output_tokens":3714,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4540},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":3714,"cache_read_input_tokens":61592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4540,"cache